# QuantumShield UI Realism

Build UI that looks like **Datadog, Snyk, or Wiz** — not a generic AI landing page.

## Visual system (use existing tokens)

- Background: `#0B0F19` (`--background`), not pure black
- Surface cards: `glass` utility or `bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/10`
- Accent: cyan `#00F0FF` for primary actions; purple sparingly
- Severity: CRITICAL `#FF3366`, HIGH orange, MEDIUM `#FFB800`, LOW cyan, INFO slate
- Fonts: **Inter** for UI, **JetBrains Mono** only for scores, IDs, logs, timestamps
- Max 1 gradient text per viewport; no rainbow hero blobs on dashboard pages

## Layout patterns

- **Sidebar** (`sidebar.tsx`): 260px expanded, icon-only collapsed, logout at bottom
- **Dashboard**: dense data first — stat row, then tables/charts; welcome banner is one compact strip, not full-screen
- **Tables**: TanStack-style — sortable columns, row hover `border-white/10`, empty states with one CTA
- **Forms**: labels above inputs, inline Zod errors, primary button right-aligned
- **Modals**: max-w-lg, title + description + actions; no decorative icons in corners

## Motion (restraint)

- Page enter: `opacity 0→1`, `y: 12→0`, 300ms max
- Stagger children 40–60ms; no bounce on data tables
- Scan progress: phase label + numeric %; holographic effects only on active scan page
- Disable `animate-pulse` except CRITICAL finding badges

## Copy tone

- Short, operational: "3 critical findings" not "Your security posture needs attention!"
- Button labels: "New scan", "Export PDF", "Deploy agent" — not "Get Started" on every button
- Empty states: state fact + action ("No scans yet. Add a domain to begin.")

## Components to reuse (extend, don't duplicate)

- `web/src/components/ui/*` — Button, Card, Badge, Input
- `web/src/components/layout/app-shell.tsx`, `sidebar.tsx`, `header.tsx`
- `web/src/components/modules/module-page.tsx` for feature pages
- `web/src/lib/constants.ts` — NAV_ITEMS, scan phases

## Anti-patterns (never)

- Centered hero with 3 feature cards and stock Lucide icons only
- "Powered by AI" badges, fake testimonial carousels, neon grid backgrounds on app pages
- Identical card grids with only icon + title + "Learn more"
- `text-gradient` on every heading
- Mock data arrays hardcoded in page components when API exists — use React Query + skeletons
- Oversized rounded-3xl everything; mix `rounded-lg` (8px) for inputs, `rounded-xl` (12px) for cards

## Data loading

- Use `@tanstack/react-query` with skeleton placeholders matching final layout
- Show real timestamps (`timeAgo`), real domain names from API
- Error states: toast + retry link, not full-page illustration

## Reference pages in this repo

- Login: `web/src/app/login/page.tsx` — compact card, demo block, no full-bleed gradient
- Dashboard: `web/src/app/dashboard/page.tsx` — stats + charts + findings list
- Scanner: `web/src/app/dashboard/scanner/new/page.tsx` — mode cards with concrete numbers (checks, duration)
